  "solution": "Given equation: 12 × 2 − 6 × 7 + 3 × 5 × 4 + 10 = 46\n\nLet's check each option by interchanging two numbers.\n\n**Option 1) Interchanging 3 and 6:**\n\nEquation becomes: 12 × 2 − 3 × 7 + 6 × 5 × 4 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**12 × 2**__ − __**3 × 7**__ + __**6 × 5**__ × 4 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ 24 − 21 + __**30 × 4**__ + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**24 − 21**__ + 120 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**3 + 120**__ + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**123 + 10**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 133 ≠ 46\n\n**Option 2) Interchanging 2 and 4:**\n\nEquation becomes: 12 × 4 − 6 × 7 + 3 × 5 × 2 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**12 × 4**__ − __**6 × 7**__ + __**3 × 5**__ × 2 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ 48 − 42 + __**15 × 2**__ + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**48 − 42**__ + 30 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**6 + 30**__ + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**36 + 10**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 46 = 46\n\n**The equation is correct when 2 and 4 are interchanged.**\n\n**Option 3) Interchanging 7 and 5:**\n\nEquation becomes: 12 × 2 − 6 × 5 + 3 × 7 × 4 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**12 × 2**__ − __**6 × 5**__ + __**3 × 7**__ × 4 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ 24 − 30 + __**21 × 4**__ + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**24 − 30**__ + 84 + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**−6 + 84**__ + 10 = 46\n\n⇒ __**78 + 10**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 88 ≠ 46\n\n**Option 4) Interchanging 12 and 10:**\n\nEquation becomes: 10 × 2 − 6 × 7 + 3 × 5 × 4 + 12 = 46\n\n⇒ __**10 × 2**__ − __**6 × 7**__ + __**3 × 5**__ × 4 + 12 = 46\n\n⇒ 20 − 42 + __**15 × 4**__ + 12 = 46\n\n⇒ __**20 − 42**__ + 60 + 12 = 46\n\n⇒ __**−22 + 60**__ + 12 = 46\n\n⇒ __**38 + 12**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 50 ≠ 46\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 2) 2 and 4**.",
